Adventure "A Broken Story (for testing the checker)":
    Begin at Arrival.

Scene Arrival:
    Narrate "Every problem in this file is deliberate."
    Option "Go to the town" leads to TheTown.
    Option "Go to the forest" leads to Forest.
    Option "Enter the maze" leads to Maze.

Scene TheTown:
    Narrate "The town square is empty."
    Option "Back to the start" leads to Entrance.

Scene Forest:
    Narrate "Trees in every direction."
    Conclude.

Scene Forest:
    Narrate "A second scene with the same name."
    Conclude.

Scene Maze:
    Narrate "The walls all look the same."
    Option "Turn left" leads to MazeCorner.
    Option "Turn right" leads to MazeCorner.

Scene MazeCorner:
    Narrate "You are back where you started."
    Proceed to Maze.
